# Docker and Local Development

- Keep Docker Compose focused on local development, not production orchestration.
- Preserve separate PostgreSQL containers and volumes for each business service.
- Configure service-to-service addresses through environment variables, not localhost assumptions inside containers.
- Add health checks and graceful shutdown only when services actually listen for traffic.
- Do not add orchestration, CI/CD, or deployment tooling unless the task requires it.
- Keep Dockerfiles small, reproducible, and aligned with the pnpm workspace layout.
